title: "CONTINUUM: verifiable semantic recovery for AI agents"
authors:
  - alias: Cyrax321
    email: cyrax8590@gmail.com
    website: "https://github.com/Cyrax321"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-24"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Cyrax321/CONTINUUM"
type: software
keywords:
  - ai-agents
  - hash-chain
  - event-log
  - idempotency
  - semantic-checkpoints
  - mcp
abstract: >-
  A research framework that makes AI agent side effects verifiable:
  an append-only, hash-chained per-run event log; an idempotent action
  ledger that refuses duplicate or uncertain side effects; semantic
  checkpoints with crash recovery; and a deny-by-default MCP server
  exposing all of it to any agent harness.
